    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Energy Cells store Forge Energy and can receive or output it through configured sides."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Their stored FE is preserved when the block is broken and placed again. The Creative Energy Cell behaves as an infinite source."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "$(bold)Ender Network use$()$(br)Shift-click an Energy Cell into an Ender Cell GUI to consume it as channel capacity. Any FE already stored in that Cell is imported into the channel too."
